IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-WIREXFR.
*> ================================================================
*> TEST-WIREXFR - Test suite for Wire Transfer Processor
*> Tests: SEND, RECV, RVRS, INQY functions (33 tests)
*> ================================================================

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-TEST-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-PASS-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-FAIL-COUNT          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  WS-TEST-NAME           PIC X(60).
01  WS-EXPECTED-LEDGER     PIC S9(13)V99.
01  WS-EXPECTED-AVAIL      PIC S9(13)V99.

*> Wire function code
01  WS-WIRE-FUNCTION       PIC X(4).

*> Wire record (replicate from CPYWIRE)
COPY CPYWIRE REPLACING ==WIRE-RECORD== BY ==WS-WIRE-RECORD==.

*> Account record from copybook
COPY CPYACCT REPLACING ==ACCT-RECORD== BY ==WS-ACCT-RECORD==.

*> Wire result
01  WS-WIRE-RESULT.
    05  WS-WIRE-RESULT-CODE    PIC X(5).
    05  WS-WIRE-RESULT-MSG     PIC X(50).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROGRAM.
    DISPLAY "========================================".
    DISPLAY "TEST SUITE: WIRE TRANSFER".
    DISPLAY "========================================".

    PERFORM TEST-WR-001
    PERFORM TEST-WR-002
    PERFORM TEST-WR-003
    PERFORM TEST-WR-004
    PERFORM TEST-WR-005
    PERFORM TEST-WR-006
    PERFORM TEST-WR-007
